      "writtenOn": "2026-10-26T17:39:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There isn\u0027t a Available. \n\nEnabled is the default state. \nSo the logic will eventually look like \n```\nIf (Present \u003d False):\n    State \u003d Absent\nElse if (Available \u003d False):\n    State \u003d UnavailableOffline\nElse if (Enabled \u003d False):\n    State \u003d Disabled\nElse if (Degraded \u003d True):\n    State \u003d Degraded \nElse:\n    State \u003d Enabled\n```\n\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/bmcweb/+/94396/3/redfish-core/include/utils/resource_utils.hpp / https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/93594 is adding degraded \n\nThis and https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/bmcweb/+/94994 are adding disabled",
